    "title": "Who from Petroplex Region area's former high school standouts will be active on Saturday, Dec. 20? - Petroplex News",
    "text": "These former Petroplex Region area high school athletes are set to compete on Saturday, Dec. 20.\nAddison Dunn\nNorthern Arizona Lumberjacks\nGuard\nFreshman\n5′10″\nMidland Classical Academy\nHometown: Midland\nNext Game: vs. UC San Diego Tritons, Saturday, Dec. 20, 3 p.m.\nElysa Martinez\nCentral Missouri Jennies\nGuard\nJunior\n5′5″\nSands High School\nHometown: Ackerly\nNext Game: vs. William Jewell Cardinals, Saturday, Dec. 20, 1 p.m.\nJoshua Cobb\nHarding Bison\nSophomore\n6′1″ 280\nMidland Christian\nHometown: Midland\nNext Game: vs. Ferris State Bulldogs, Saturday, Dec. 20, 3 p.m.\nLandry Morrow\nAngelo State Rams\nGuard\nSenior\n5′8″\nSands High School\nHometown: Ackerly\nNext Game: vs. Emporia State Hornets, Saturday, Dec. 20, 1 p.m.",
